refused) | | localhost:5000/node-api:main | the registry on localhost:5000 | | ghcr.io/OWNER/node-api:main | GitHub Container Registry,

49
00:04:03,964 --> 00:04:08,944
owner OWNER | The same mistake in the workflow looks different:

50
00:04:08,944 --> 00:04:12,027
pushing to ghcr.io without permissions:

51
00:04:12,027 --> 00:04:12,739
packages:

52
00:04:12,739 --> 00:04:14,636
write fails with denied:

53
00:04:14,636 --> 00:04:20,723
installation not allowed to Create organization package or permission_denied:

54
00:04:20,723 --> 00:04:21,830
write_package.

55
00:04:23,567 --> 00:04:30,026
Name the image after its destination, as the metadata step does with images:

56
00:04:30,026 --> 00:04:30,876
ghcr.io/…:

57
00:04:32,633 --> 00:04:33,347
Got it.

58
00:04:33,347 --> 00:04:36,098
What do I need to remember?

59
00:04:36,633 --> 00:04:41,898
GitHub Actions runs the same Docker steps as a local script:

60
00:04:41,898 --> 00:04:44,618
test stage, build, login, push.

61
00:04:45,167 --> 00:04:47,941
GITHUB_TOKEN with permissions:

62
00:04:47,941 --> 00:04:48,773
packages:

63
00:04:48,773 --> 00:04:53,766
write pushes to ghcr.io/OWNER/...; no stored password.

64
00:04:54,300 --> 00:05:00,720
Pin actions to commit SHAs; tag images with the commit, the branch and the release version.

65
00:05:02,467 --> 00:05:05,656
How does scanning and testing in CI work?

66
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:08,600
Unit tests prove the code works.

67
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:14,601
Before an image is pushed, a pipeline should also prove the image is acceptable:

68
00:05:14,601 --> 00:05:20,377
it starts and answers (smoke test), it follows the team's rules (policy gate:

69
00:05:20,377 --> 00:05:24,053
non-root, healthcheck, no secrets, a size budget,

70
00:05:24,053 --> 00:05:30,128
a version tag), and it has no known serious vulnerabilities (vulnerability scan).

71
00:05:30,128 --> 00:05:38,080
Each gate is a command that exits non-zero when the image fails it, so the pipeline stops before the push.

72
00:05:39,833 --> 00:05:43,793
