93
00:07:04,347 --> 00:07:07,098
What do I need to remember?

94
00:07:07,633 --> 00:07:10,900
Gate the image, not only the code:

95
00:07:10,900 --> 00:07:14,648
smoke test, policy, vulnerability scan.

96
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:21,965
Each gate is a command with a non-zero exit code on failure, so the pipeline stops before the push.

97
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:27,254
A policy gate is a few docker image inspect queries:

98
00:07:27,254 --> 00:07:31,095
user, healthcheck, environment, size, tag.
